   "seed": 1893501693,
   "version": 4,
   "versionNonce": 776778432,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1789253501552,
   "created": 1789114324778,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "API Design\n\nThe HTTP examples use toy values.\nThe response lines list field names.\n\nPOST /v1/score-ais\n{\n  \"mmsi\": 1,\n  \"fix\": {\"lat\": 29.3, \"lon\": -94.8,\n          \"t\": \"2026-09-11T12:00:00Z\"}\n}\n200 -> {mmsi, score, confidence, reasons,\n        hitl_required, trace_id,\n        latency_ms, n_history}\n\nGET /v1/hitl/pending\n200 -> pending review rows\n\nPOST /v1/feedback\n{\"trace_id\": \"<case trace_id>\",\n \"label\": \"correct\", \"reviewer\": \"toy-reviewer\"}\n200 -> {accepted, queue_position}\n404 -> harbormaster.hitl_trace_not_found\n\nThe CDC interface carries Kafka events.\n{op, before, after, source: {table, lsn}, ts_ms}\nkey = {tenant_id, mmsi}\n\nThe lane path uses batch/file interfaces.\nrun(spark, raw_extract_s3_uri=extract_uri,\n    catalog_props=catalog_props)\nload_corridors(artifact_path)\n\nThe model-job HTTP wrapper is proposed.\nPOST /v1/model-jobs\nGET /v1/model-jobs/{job_id}\nGET /v1/model-jobs/{job_id}/result\n\nThe model-job service is not in this public snapshot.",
   "fontSize": 21,
   "baseFontSize": null,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "2ogFkQEots4gh9_3JUpYQ",
   "originalText": "API Design\n\nThe HTTP examples use toy values.\nThe response lines list field names.\n\nPOST /v1/score-ais\n{\n  \"mmsi\": 1,\n  \"fix\": {\"lat\": 29.3, \"lon\": -94.8,\n          \"t\": \"2026-09-11T12:00:00Z\"}\n}\n200 -> {mmsi, score, confidence, reasons,\n        hitl_required, trace_id,\n        latency_ms, n_history}\n\nGET /v1/hitl/pending\n200 -> pending review rows\n\nPOST /v1/feedback\n{\"trace_id\": \"<case trace_id>\",\n \"label\": \"correct\", \"reviewer\": \"toy-reviewer\"}\n200 -> {accepted, queue_position}\n404 -> harbormaster.hitl_trace_not_found\n\nThe CDC interface carries Kafka events.\n{op, before, after, source: {table, lsn}, ts_ms}\nkey = {tenant_id, mmsi}\n\nThe lane path uses batch/file interfaces.\nrun(spark, raw_extract_s3_uri=extract_uri,\n    catalog_props=catalog_props)\nload_corridors(artifact_path)\n\nThe model-job HTTP wrapper is proposed.\nPOST /v1/model-jobs\nGET /v1/model-jobs/{job_id}\nGET /v1/model-jobs/{job_id}/result\n\nThe model-job service is not in this public snapshot.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "labelPosition": null
  },
